ry guarantee). Message offsets that help consumers (The Backend Spring Boot Application here) track the point till which messages have been consumed from the Kafka queue.   Deployment of the messaging application with the Kafka broker to the cloud (AWS) where replicated instances are maintained which are served with Elastic Load Balancers to forward requests fairly. ","topics":[],"score":213711,"global_rank":258580},{"name":"liahnee/portfolio","owner":"liahnee","html_url":"https://github.com/liahnee/portfolio","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":22,"language":"JavaScript","description":"portfolio","topics":[],"score":213710,"global_rank":258588},{"name":"atneik/gatsby-starter-netlify-cms","owner":"atneik","html_url":"https://github.com/atneik/gatsby-starter-netlify-cms","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":26,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":213710,"global_rank":258589},{"name":"atorres6d5/Grumble-frontend","owner":"atorres6d5","html_url":"https://github.com/atorres6d5/Grumble-frontend","stars":0,"forks":2,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":213708,"global_rank":258591},{"name":"ZackMFleischman/HelloTypescript","owner":"ZackMFleischman","html_url":"https://github.com/ZackMFleischman/HelloTypescript","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":2,"issues":23,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":213705,"global_rank":258600},{"name":"lechrsty/vinyl-cut","owner":"lechrsty","html_url":"https://github.com/lechrsty/vinyl-cut","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":122,"language":"JavaScript","description":"Full-Stack CRUD application for a record store that provides a vinyl subscription service, as well as a platform for dedicated music lovers to share what albums they've been digging (or not). Styled with Vanilla CSS.","topics":[],"score":213704,"global_rank":258601},{"name":"Sean-Cesmat/react-blog","owner":"Sean-Cesmat","html_url":"https://github.com/Sean-Cesmat/rea